<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title><%= fh.num %> — Service Certificate — <%= worker.name %></title>
<style>
* { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
body { font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif; font-size:11pt; color:#000; background:#f0f0f0; line-height:1.6; }
.print-bar { background:#1e40af; padding:8px 16px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; }
.print-bar span { color:#fff; font-family:system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:13px; flex:1; }
.print-bar a { color:#bfdbfe; font-family:system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:12px; text-decoration:underline; }
.print-bar button { background:#fff; color:#1e40af; border:none; border-radius:6px; padding:6px 18px; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; }
.page { width:210mm; min-height:297mm; background:#fff; margin:12px auto; padding:16mm 20mm 14mm; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.18); }
.form-id { text-align:center; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; margin-bottom:6px; }
.letterhead { text-align:center; border-bottom:2px solid #333; padding-bottom:8px; margin-bottom:18px; }
.letterhead .co-name { font-size:16pt; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:.04em; }
.letterhead .co-detail { font-size:9pt; color:#444; margin-top:3px; }
.cert-title { text-align:center; margin:16px 0 14px; }
.cert-title h2 { font-size:14pt; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; }
.cert-title .form-cite { font-size:9pt; font-style:italic; color:#555; margin-top:3px; }
.details-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:14px 0; font-size:10.5pt; }
.details-table td { padding:5px 6px; vertical-align:top; border:0.7px solid #777; }
.details-table .lbl { font-weight:bold; width:46%; background:#f8f8f8; }
.cert-body { text-indent:2.5em; margin-bottom:12px; text-align:justify; font-size:10.5pt; }
.cert-body strong { font-weight:bold; }
.conduct-box { border:0.7px solid #aaa; padding:8px 14px; margin:12px 0; font-size:10.5pt; }
.seal-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:44px; font-size:10pt; }
.seal-box { text-align:center; }
.sig-line { border-top:0.8px solid #555; padding-top:5px; margin-top:32px; width:180px; text-align:center; font-size:9.5pt; }
.footnote { font-size:8pt; font-style:italic; color:#555; margin-top:18px; border-top:0.5px solid #bbb; padding-top:6px; }
@media print {
  body { background:#fff; }
  .print-bar { display:none !important; }
  .page { margin:0; box-shadow:none; padding:12mm 18mm 10mm; }
  @page { size:A4 portrait; margin:0; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="print-bar">
  <span><%= fh.num %> — Service Certificate — <%= worker.name %></span>
  <a href="/workers/<%= worker.id %>">← Back to profile</a>
  <button onclick="window.print()">⬇ Print / Save PDF</button>
</div>
<div class="page">

  <div class="form-id"><%= fh.num %> &nbsp;|&nbsp; (<%= fh.rule %>)</div>

  <div class="letterhead">
    <div class="co-name"><%= company.name %></div>
    <div class="co-detail"><%= establishment.address %></div>
    <% if (company.contact_phone) { %><div class="co-detail">Ph: <%= company.contact_phone %></div><% } %>
    <% if (company.contact_email) { %><div class="co-detail">Email: <%= company.contact_email %></div><% } %>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align:right; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:10pt">
    Date of Issue: <strong><%= issueDate %></strong>
  </div>

  <div class="cert-title">
    <h2>Service Certificate</h2>
    <div class="form-cite">Issued under <%= fh.note %></div>
  </div>

  <div class="cert-body">
    This is to certify that <strong><%= worker.name %></strong><% if (worker.fatherName) { %>,
    S/o / D/o / W/o <strong><%= worker.fatherName %></strong>,<% } %>
    was employed with <strong><%= company.name %></strong><% if (site) { %>
    at <strong><%= site.name %></strong><% } %>
    in the capacity of <strong><%= worker.designation %></strong> and has worked to our satisfaction during the period of employment.
  </div>

  <table class="details-table">
    <tr>
      <td class="lbl">1. Name of Worker</td>
      <td><%= worker.name %></td>
    </tr>
    <% if (worker.fatherName) { %>
    <tr>
      <td class="lbl">2. Father's / Mother's / Spouse Name</td>
      <td><%= worker.fatherName %></td>
    </tr>
    <% } %>
    <tr>
      <td class="lbl">3. Designation / Category of Work</td>
      <td><%= worker.designation %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="lbl">4. Date of Joining</td>
      <td><%= worker.doj %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="lbl">5. Date of Leaving / Last Working Day</td>
      <td>____________________________</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="lbl">6. Reason for Leaving</td>
      <td>____________________________</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="lbl">7. Last Drawn Wage Rate</td>
      <td>₹ <%= worker.wageRate %> per day</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="conduct-box">
    <strong>Conduct &amp; Behaviour during service:</strong><br>
    <span style="padding-left:1em">Good / Satisfactory / Average &nbsp; (circle as applicable)</span><br><br>
    <strong>Skills / Nature of Work performed:</strong><br>
    <span style="padding-left:1em">____________________________________________________________________</span>
  </div>

  <div class="cert-body">
    This certificate is issued at the request of the above-named worker for whatever purpose it may serve.
    We wish the worker all the best in future endeavours.
  </div>

  <div class="seal-row">
    <div class="seal-box">
      <div class="sig-line">
        Signature of Worker<br>(<%= worker.name %>)
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="seal-box">
      <div style="font-size:8.5pt; color:#aaa; margin-bottom:4px">(Affix company seal here)</div>
      <div class="sig-line">
        For <%= company.name %><br>(Authorised Signatory with Designation)
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footnote">
    * This service certificate has been issued in accordance with <%= fh.note %>.<br>
    Note: Required in case register is maintained physically. The employer is required to issue this certificate on the date of separation of the worker.
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
